 "La botella 3D gira sola con bordes difuminados. Un clic y los cinco consejos entran seguidos. En mayores, la sed aparece tarde: hay que ofrecer agua aunque no la pidan.": "The 3D bottle turns on its own with soft edges. One click and the five tips come in one after another. In older people thirst comes late: offer water even if they don't ask.",
