 "Botella": "Bottle",
 "<span style=\"color:#2b7bb9;font-weight:800\">1.</span> Agua a menudo, aunque no tengas sed": "<span style=\"color:#2b7bb9;font-weight:800\">1.</span> Water often, even if you're not thirsty",
